  "View and edit network interface configuration.\n\n  • Enable/disable DHCP and IPv6 auto-configuration\n  • Add or remove static IP aliases\n  • Set MTU, VLAN tag, bridge members, LAG ports, and more\n  • Apply changes (with automatic rollback safety)\n  • Persist changes once the network is confirmed working\n\nPress Enter to select an interface to edit.\nPress [n] to create a new interface, [d] to delete.\nAfter editing, use [a] to Apply and [p] to Persist.": {
    "machine_translated": true,
    "translation": "Ogled in urejanje konfiguracije omrežnega vmesnika.\n\n  • Omogoči/onemogoči samodejno konfiguracijo DHCP in IPv6\n  • Dodajte ali odstranite statične naslove IP\n  • Nastavite MTU, oznako VLAN, člane mostu, vrata LAG in drugo\n  • Uporabite spremembe (s samodejnim varnostnim povrnitvijo)\n  • Ohranite spremembe, ko je potrjeno, da omrežje deluje\n\nPritisnite Enter, da izberete vmesnik za urejanje.\nPritisnite [n] za ustvarjanje novega vmesnika, [d] za brisanje.\nPo urejanju uporabite [a] za Uporabi in [p] za Vztrajanje."
  },
  "View your account information and manage credentials.\n\n  • View username, UID, roles, and 2FA status\n  • Change your password\n  • Generate a one-time password for single-use login\n  • Set up or renew two-factor authentication\n\nPassword changes take effect immediately.\nOne-time passwords expire after a single login.": {
    "machine_translated": true,
    "translation": "Ogled podatkov o vašem računu in upravljanje poverilnic.\n\n  • Oglejte si uporabniško ime, UID, vloge in status 2FA\n  • Spremenite geslo\n  • Ustvarite enkratno geslo za enkratno prijavo\n  • Nastavite ali obnovite dvostopenjsko avtentikacijo\n\nSpremembe gesla stopijo v veljavo takoj.\nEnkratna gesla potečejo po enkratni prijavi."
  },
